---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="About Us — Iceland Camp Gear"
  description="We're passionate Icelanders who believe everyone should experience the country's wild landscapes. Learn about Iceland Camp Gear's story and values."
>

  <div class="page-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <span class="badge badge--white">Our Story</span>
      <h1>About Iceland Camp Gear</h1>
      <p>Born from a love of Iceland's wild places — and a frustration with overpriced, poor-quality gear rentals.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Story section -->
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container about-story">
      <div class="story-image">
        <img
          src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6610569bb1d54fb87d56726f/683dce76c6a35e7e2340197b_DJI_0069.jpg"
          alt="Iceland's stunning landscape"
          loading="lazy"
        />
        <div class="story-image-caption">The Icelandic wilderness — our playground and our passion</div>
      </div>
      <div class="story-text">
        <span class="badge badge--green">How it started</span>
        <h2>Iceland deserves better gear</h2>
        <p>We started Iceland Camp Gear after one too many conversations with frustrated travellers who'd rented gear that let them down — leaking tents, sleeping bags that weren't warm enough, stoves that failed in the wind.</p>
        <p>Iceland's landscape is extraordinary, but it demands quality equipment. The weather changes fast. The wind can be brutal. Temperatures in the highlands drop well below zero even in August. We decided that if we were going to rent gear, it would only be gear we'd actually use ourselves.</p>
        <p>Everything in our fleet is hand-selected from the world's best outdoor brands — Hilleberg, MSR, Therm-a-Rest, Black Diamond, Sea to Summit. If we wouldn't trust it in a storm above Landmannalaugar, we won't rent it to you.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Values -->
  <section class="section section--tint">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-header">
        <span class="badge badge--green">What We Stand For</span>
        <h2>Our values</h2>
        <div class="divider"></div>
      </div>

      <div class="values-grid">
        <div class="value-item">
          <div class="value-icon">🏔️</div>
          <h3>Quality Without Compromise</h3>
          <p>We only carry gear we believe in. Every item is selected for performance in Iceland's specific conditions — not just marketing specs.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="value-item">
          <div class="value-icon">🌿</div>
          <h3>Leave No Trace</h3>
          <p>Iceland's nature is fragile. We encourage all our customers to follow Leave No Trace principles and use designated campsites wherever possible.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="value-item">
          <div class="value-icon">🤝</div>
          <h3>Honest Advice</h3>
          <p>We'll tell you what you actually need for your trip — not upsell you on gear you don't. Sometimes less is more.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="value-item">
          <div class="value-icon">🛡️</div>
          <h3>Safety First</h3>
          <p>Camping in Iceland can be dangerous without proper gear and knowledge. We'll always make sure you have what you need to stay safe.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Team / photo -->
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-header">
        <span class="badge badge--green">The Landscape</span>
        <h2>The country we love</h2>
        <div class="divider"></div>
        <p>Iceland is unlike anywhere else on Earth. From the volcanic highlands to the glacial south coast, every corner of this island rewards those who are willing to explore.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="about-gallery">
        <div class="about-gallery-main">
          <img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6610569bb1d54fb87d56726f/683dddd306c3e8c9f0cd6d2c_DJI_0042.jpg" alt="Aerial Iceland landscape" loading="lazy" />
        </div>
        <div class="about-gallery-side">
          <img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6610569bb1d54fb87d56726f/6633b96280bdb9d20fa56da9_0B7A5368.jpeg" alt="Camping in Iceland" loading="lazy" />
          <img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6610569bb1d54fb87d56726f/6633b6346fa8b47bafe2cf0f_0B7A5459.jpeg" alt="Iceland gear" loading="lazy" />
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Stats -->
  <section class="section section--dark">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="stats-row">
        <div class="stat-item">
          <strong>2018</strong>
          <span>Founded in Reykjavík</span>
        </div>
        <div class="stat-item">
          <strong>500+</strong>
          <span>Happy customers</span>
        </div>
        <div class="stat-item">
          <strong>200+</strong>
          <span>Pieces of equipment</span>
        </div>
        <div class="stat-item">
          <strong>5★</strong>
          <span>Average rating</span>
        </div>
        <div class="stat-item">
          <strong>12+</strong>
          <span>Top brands stocked</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Sustainability -->
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container sustainability">
      <div>
        <img
          src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6610569bb1d54fb87d56726f/665f211c6cf86c45992d44cd_0B7A7792.JPG"
          alt="Iceland nature"
          loading="lazy"
          class="sust-img"
        />
      </div>
      <div class="sust-text">
        <span class="badge badge--green">Sustainability</span>
        <h2>Protecting what makes Iceland special</h2>
        <p>Iceland's wilderness is its greatest treasure. Renting gear instead of buying is inherently more sustainable — fewer products manufactured, fewer bags on planes, less waste overall.</p>
        <p>Beyond that, we're committed to:</p>
        <ul class="sust-list">
          <li>Using only biodegradable cleaning products on all gear</li>
          <li>Minimising plastic packaging</li>
          <li>Extending the lifespan of equipment through quality maintenance and repair</li>
          <li>Partnering with Iceland's camping organisations to promote responsible camping</li>
          <li>Donating 2% of profits to Icelandic nature conservation</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- CTA -->
  <section class="cta-strip">
    <div class="container cta-inner">
      <div>
        <h2>Ready to plan your Iceland adventure?</h2>
        <p>Get in touch — we'd love to help you prepare for the trip of a lifetime.</p>
      </div>
      <a href={`${import.meta.env.BASE_URL}contact`} class="btn btn--dark">Contact Us</a>
    </div>
  </section>

</Layout>

<style>
.about-story {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
  gap: 4rem;
  align-items: start;
}
.story-image img {
  width: 100%;
  border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
  aspect-ratio: 4/3;
  object-fit: cover;
}
.story-image-caption {
  font-size: .8rem;
  color: var(--color-muted);
  text-align: center;
  margin-top: .75rem;
}
.story-text .badge { margin-bottom: .75rem; }
.story-text h2 { margin-bottom: 1rem; }
.story-text p { margin-bottom: 1rem; font-size: .97rem; color: var(--color-mid); }

.values-grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(min(240px,100%),1fr));
  gap: 2rem;
}
.value-item { text-align: center; }
.value-icon { font-size: 2.5rem; margin-bottom: .75rem; }
.value-item h3 { font-size: 1.1rem; margin-bottom: .5rem; }
.value-item p { font-size: .9rem; color: var(--color-mid); }

.about-gallery {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 2fr 1fr;
  gap: 1rem;
  border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
  overflow: hidden;
}
.about-gallery-main img {
  width: 100%;
  height: 100%;
  object-fit: cover;
  min-height: 300px;
}
.about-gallery-side {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-rows: 1fr 1fr;
  gap: 1rem;
}
.about-gallery-side img {
  width: 100%;
  height: 100%;
  object-fit: cover;
  border-radius: var(--radius-md);
}

.stats-row {
  display: flex;
  justify-content: space-around;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
  gap: 2rem;
}
.stat-item { text-align: center; }
.stat-item strong {
  display: block;
  font-size: 3rem;
  font-family: var(--font-serif);
  color: var(--color-green-light);
  line-height: 1.1;
}
.stat-item span { font-size: .85rem; color: rgba(255,255,255,.55); }

.sustainability {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 1fr 1.2fr;
  gap: 4rem;
  align-items: center;
}
.sust-img {
  width: 100%;
  border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
  aspect-ratio: 3/4;
  object-fit: cover;
}
.sust-text .badge { margin-bottom: .75rem; }
.sust-text h2 { margin-bottom: 1rem; }
.sust-text p { font-size: .95rem; color: var(--color-mid); margin-bottom: .75rem; }
.sust-list { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: .5rem; margin-top: .5rem; }
.sust-list li { font-size: .9rem; color: var(--color-dark); padding-left: 1rem; position: relative; }
.sust-list li::before { content: '✓'; position: absolute; left: 0; color: var(--color-green); font-weight: 700; }

.cta-strip {
  background: var(--color-green);
  padding-block: 3rem;
}
.cta-inner {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: space-between;
  gap: 2rem;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
}
.cta-inner h2 { color: var(--color-white); }
.cta-inner p { color: rgba(255,255,255,.8); margin-top: .25rem; }

@media (max-width: 768px) {
  .about-story { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 2rem; }
  .about-gallery { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  .about-gallery-side { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; grid-template-rows: auto; }
  .sustainability { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  .cta-inner { flex-direction: column; text-align: center; }
}
</style>
